Port 22
AddressFamily any
HostKey /etc/ssh/hostkeys/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/sshd.pid
UsePAM no
PermitRootLogin no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
AllowUsers photo-backup
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/ssh/photo-backup_authorized_keys
StrictModes yes
MaxAuthTries 3
LoginGraceTime 20
LogLevel VERBOSE
SyslogFacility AUTHPRIV
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PermitTTY no
PermitUserEnvironment no
PermitUserRC no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp

Match User photo-backup
    ChrootDirectory /srv/sftp
    ForceCommand internal-sftp -d /upload -u 0027 -l INFO
    AuthenticationMethods publickey
    AllowTcpForwarding no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
    PermitTunnel no
    PermitTTY no
